---
title: "HNTD search: from the form to the shortlist"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: waiting
    lg1: running
    lg2: done
    lg3: failed
    lg4: gone
    lg5: Breaks CompletedHasResults or NoResultsForDeletedSearch
    lg6: Path to the CompletedHasResults or NoResultsForDeletedSearch bug
  }
  class lg0 tan
  class lg1 blue
  class lg2 teal
  class lg3 orange
  class lg4 purple
  class lg5 breaks
  class lg6 bugPath
  s0: No search yet
  s1: In queue
  s2: Deleted
  s3: In queue, the pipeline is preparing
  s4: Deleted, the pipeline still works on it
  s5: Failed
  s6: Processing
  s7: In queue, a run still works on it
  s8: Processing, no pipeline run alive
  s9: Completed, shortlist shown
  s10: Deleted, a shortlist is left behind
  s11: Completed, no shortlist stored
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: you start a search
  s1 --> s3: a pipeline run reads the queue
  s3 --> s1: the Claude Code session ends mid-run
  s3 --> s5: the run reports a failure
  s3 --> s6: the run starts searching GitHub
  s4 --> s2: the run stops, the search is gone
  s5 --> s1: you reset it from the terminal
  s6 --> s5: the run reports a failure
  s6 --> s4: you delete the search
  s6 --> s7: the watchdog requeues it [30 minutes in processing] or you reset it from the terminal
  s6 --> s8: the Claude Code session ends mid-run
  s6 --> s6: the run stores the shortlist
  s4 --> s10: the run stores the shortlist
  s7 --> s1: the Claude Code session ends mid-run
  s7 --> s5: the run reports a failure
  s8 --> s1: the watchdog requeues it [30 minutes in processing] or you reset it from the terminal
  s6 --> s9: the run marks it completed
  s9 --> s1: you reset it from the terminal
  s7 --> s11: the run marks it completed, the reset wiped its shortlist
  s7 --> s9: the run marks it completed
  s11 --> s1: you reset it from the terminal
  classDef breaks fill:#ffecee,stroke:#e72e3b,stroke-width:2.5px,color:#cd2834
  class s0 tan
  class s0 bugPath
  class s1 tan
  class s1 bugPath
  class s2 purple
  class s3 tan
  class s3 bugPath
  class s4 purple
  class s4 bugPath
  class s5 orange
  class s6 blue
  class s6 bugPath
  class s7 tan
  class s7 bugPath
  class s8 blue
  class s9 teal
  class s10 purple
  class s10 breaks
  class s10 bugPath
  class s11 teal
  class s11 breaks
  class s11 bugPath
